  "releaseNotes": "feat(memory): add operator overloads and consolidate AsSpan validation\n\n      - Add intuitive operators: `+` (append), `<<`/`>>` (shift offset), and `==`/`!=` (buffer/span comparison).\n      - Standardize `AsSpan` as the single validation source for boundary safety.\n      - Keep `Slice` internal for raw array access without offset constraints.\n      - Pass 100% unit tests with zero performance impact.",
